    <input type="hidden" value="The GSW-350-X series products are 350W fan-cooled industrial power supplies with a metal casing. The entire series features wide voltage AC/DC input, with output voltages including 12V/24V/36V/48V/55V. They possess excellent peak power load capacity, suitable for various load application requirements to meet most industrial application needs. Additionally, the product's EMC and safety standards comply with international IEC/EN/UL62368 and GB4943 standards. High conversion efficiency, compact casing design, good heat dissipation, and comprehensive protection ensure the high reliability and stability of this series of products." name="dataSummary">
