    <input type="hidden" value="The A-1000FKK-XP series is a 1000W single-output industrial control power supply with a voltage input range of 90~264VAC. The output voltage options include 12V, 15V, 24V, 27V, 36V, and 48V. It also features built-in output ON/OFF control, remote output voltage compensation, a 5V auxiliary source output, and supports output current sharing backup. This makes it suitable for various industrial fields such as industrial control systems, machinery and electrical equipment, electronic instruments, industrial automation, and household appliances. Its ultra-high efficiency and good heat dissipation ensure that this series of products can operate stably for a long time." name="dataSummary">
